I am back in the office.
I sit at my desk and write code.
Jonas comes over to me.
"Maya, do you have a moment?", he asks.
"Yes, of course," I answer.
He has a question about the software.
Jonas points at my screen.
We look at the problem together.
We read the code and discuss a few ideas.
"Maybe we do it like this?", I ask.
I change the code and we test the software.
Unfortunately, it does not work.
Then Jonas has another idea.
He explains it to me.
I type on my keyboard again.
We test the software one more time.
Now everything works perfectly.
We find a very good solution.
"Great, thanks Maya!", Jonas says.
He goes back to his seat, and I continue working.
